[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727545384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104205#issuecomment-2727545384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104205","id":2727545384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikwoo","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T17:06:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T17:06:35Z","body":"Each video seems to show 3 separate issues, I think. I would heavily recommend reporting each individually.\nRegardless, the first two are likely bugs. The last one is absolutely _not_ a problem anymore because the behaviour has changed.\n\nFor the first issue, note that by dismissing the tooltip with ESC, the tooltip timer is also reset. If ESC is held and the tooltip timer is waited out, the tooltip does not appear. This hints at the possible oversight.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727545384/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730456823","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104205#issuecomment-2730456823","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104205","id":2730456823,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iv3b3","user":{"login":"quinnyo","id":3379314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzkzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3379314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo","html_url":"https://github.com/quinnyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T18:18:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T18:18:49Z","body":"I'd be happy to split the issue up, but I'm not seeing the differences that you're seeing. What are the three (or two?) separate issues?\n\nThe issue I was trying to report and that is common to all three videos is that the tooltip is shown more than once without the cursor (re)entering the region that triggers the tooltip. The reason I included more than one way to dismiss a tooltip, and different controls/tooltips was to demonstrate that commonality.\n\nThe relevant behaviour in the second and third videos appears identical to me. The tooltip is dismissed when the mouse is moved, the mouse lingers, and then the tooltip reappears. I'm not sure what the behaviour is that has changed.\n\n> If ESC is held and the tooltip timer is waited out, the tooltip does not appear.\n\nI just tried this and found that the tooltips do appear. This is on 4.4, with nodes in the scene tree like in the video.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730456823/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730527945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104205#issuecomment-2730527945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104205","id":2730527945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iwIzJ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T18:50:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T18:50:46Z","body":"> The relevant behaviour in the second and third videos appears identical to me. The tooltip is dismissed when the mouse is moved, the mouse lingers, and then the tooltip reappears. I'm not sure what the behaviour is that has changed.\n\nIt's worth first noting that there's a difference between the **default** tooltip _(the one with black background and no text formatting)_, and a **custom** tooltip _(like the one used in the Inspector for documentation tooltips)_. The logic that requires them to appear is the same, but dismissing it may be different.\n\nIn the first video, the tooltip appears again even after it has been dismissed manually with `ESC`. This is objectively a bug. Probably also means the tooltip timer is reset when it shouldn't be.\n\nIn the second video, a nudge of the cursor causes the **custom** tooltip to disappear, even within the bounds of the label. It's _possible_ this is intentional, because as you're scrolling through each property's description, you may not want the tooltip to linger for too long. On the other hand, it makes clicking on the tooltip's links almost impossible. (@dalexeev )\n\nIn the third video, a nudge of the cursor causes the **default** tooltip to disappear, even within the bounds of the Button. This behavior is not present in `4.4`. If the cursor is moved to a new position, but the tooltip's string would still be the same, the tooltip is not dismissed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730527945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847939046","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104205#issuecomment-2847939046","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104205","id":2847939046,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pwBnm","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T19:24:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T19:24:27Z","body":"Both issues should fixed by 4.5dev2","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847939046/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848739926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104205#issuecomment-2848739926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104205","id":2848739926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pzFJW","user":{"login":"quinnyo","id":3379314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzkzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3379314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo","html_url":"https://github.com/quinnyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q